{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00448",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 3.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. It's my turn, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.03,
      "end_seconds": 8.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.76,
      "end_seconds": 14.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I've been feeling lightheaded, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.59,
      "end_seconds": 18.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "And when did that start? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.39,
      "end_seconds": 25.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "It's been three days now. And, And blurred vision for a few seconds, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.05,
      "end_seconds": 29.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.27,
      "end_seconds": 32.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.28,
      "end_seconds": 35.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.38,
      "end_seconds": 42.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.96,
      "end_seconds": 56.96,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.52,
      "end_seconds": 60.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.98,
      "end_seconds": 66.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.21,
      "end_seconds": 70.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.54,
      "end_seconds": 72.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.38,
      "end_seconds": 76.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.13,
      "end_seconds": 79.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.95,
      "end_seconds": 84.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.87,
      "end_seconds": 86.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Telmisartan, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.15,
      "end_seconds": 89.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.6,
      "end_seconds": 91.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "40 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.52,
      "end_seconds": 100.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.65,
      "end_seconds": 101.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.7,
      "end_seconds": 106.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.34,
      "end_seconds": 119.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.93,
      "end_seconds": 145.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 98 over 57, pulse 95, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.1,
      "end_seconds": 149.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.13,
      "end_seconds": 150.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.96,
      "end_seconds": 159.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.43,
      "end_seconds": 163.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.87,
      "end_seconds": 167.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.33,
      "end_seconds": 178.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Heart rhythm is regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.92,
      "end_seconds": 181.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.49,
      "end_seconds": 202.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Your blood pressure drops when you stand, I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.09,
      "end_seconds": 218.22,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with postural low blood pressure at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.26,
      "end_seconds": 221.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.8,
      "end_seconds": 237.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.42,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now postural low blood pressure is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling lightheaded for three days, and no weakness or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.42,
      "end_seconds": 240.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.02,
      "end_seconds": 245.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.07,
      "end_seconds": 260.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.72,
      "end_seconds": 288.1,
      "duration_seconds": 26.38,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ECG, for dizziness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Get up in stages, sit on the edge of the bed for a minute first, and keep drinking water. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.48,
      "end_seconds": 290.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.05,
      "end_seconds": 295.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.96,
      "end_seconds": 301.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.99,
      "end_seconds": 306.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.35,
      "end_seconds": 309.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.43,
      "end_seconds": 311.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}